This product bundles third-party data:

Emoji metadata — emoji-data
  https://github.com/iamcal/emoji-data
  Copyright (c) 2013 Cal Henderson
  Licensed under the MIT License.

  Bundled as EmoPic/Resources/emoji-data.json: emoji names, shortcodes, Unicode
  codepoints, categories, sort order and skin-tone variation mappings.

  Only that JSON metadata is included. No sprite sheets or image files from
  emoji-data are redistributed with EmoPic — emoji are rendered as text using the
  fonts already installed on your Mac (Apple Color Emoji on macOS), which remain
  subject to Apple's own terms. Some emoji-text fields and vendor codepoint
  mappings in the metadata reference image sets we do not ship.
